{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102126","id":2302489901,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6JPTUt","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102126","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102126.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102126.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102126","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102126/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102126/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102126/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/60443b1ae6277bf6854a403380803e3f3c6677f1","number":102126,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Optimize `ProjectSettings::get_setting_with_override` / `GLOBAL_GET` by avoiding repeated dict lookups.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Ran across this inefficiency, couldn't help myself from improving it. The improvement is unlikely to be important.\r\n\r\nThe macro `GLOBAL_GET` (used about 750 times across the project) calls this function.\r\nIn the previous implementation, it performs `3` dict lookups when there are no overrides, and `4 + N + 1` lookups when there are.\r\nIn my implementation, it performs `2` dict lookups when there are no overrides, and `1 + N + 1` when there are.\r\n\r\nI also hope the new implementation is more readable.\r\n\r\n## Benchmark\r\nI measured a 10% improvement of efficiency:\r\n```c++\r\n\tauto t0 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\tfor (int i = 0; i < 30000000; i ++) {\r\n\t\t// Test\r\n\t\tVariant v = GLOBAL_GET(\"application/config/name\");\r\n\t}\r\n\tauto t1 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\tstd::cout << std::chrono::duration_cast<std::chrono::milliseconds>(t1 - t0).count() << \"ms\\n\";\r\n```\r\n- `2214ms` on master (e5498020b6250d9284efcdcf0f85f39d48d8548f)\r\n- `1981ms` on this pr (374aa902200ca999e1f541f298d7327df50676e9)\r\n\r\n(I think this is testing the _no overrides_ path)\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\nIn the overrides path, `has_feature` is more likely to cause actual problems. It allocates a new string for every call due to the implicit conversion from `StringName` to `String`.\r\nIn the non-overrides path, it is already quite fast, I think.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":